SEGMNT3
*0001
 
 
/FRAME 1
/   MARK12
/THIS PROGRAM WILL FORMAT AND CHECK 
/LINC TAPES FOR THE PDP-12
 
/SELECT OPTION AND PRESS LINE FEED 
/ON THE CONSOLE TELETYPE
 
/SELECT -
 
/ 1 STD LINC FORMAT
 
/ P 129 WORD FORMAT
 
/ B 1600 STD BLKS
	 
/ H 2000 STD BLKS
	 
/ D DOUBLE MARKED TAPE
 
/FRAME 2
 
/MOUNT TAPE TO BE
/MARKED ON THE RIGHT
/REEL OF UNIT 1
 
/PLACE UNIT 1 IN
/REMOTE WITH
/WRITE ENABLED, THEN
 
/PRESS THE MARK SWITCH
 
 
/FRAME 3
 
/   GOOD TAPE
 
/ALLOW MARKED TAPE TO REWIND
/THEN SELECT OPTION AND TYPE
/LINE FEED ON THE TELETYPE
 
/SELECT -
 
/ 1 MARK ANOTHER TAPE
 
/ 2 RESTART DIAL
 
 
 
/FRAME 4
 
/TAPE CHECK FAILED
 
/SELECT -
 
/ 1 MARK ANOTHER TAPE
 
/ 2 RESTART DIAL
 
 
DS1,	TEXT ZF    DANMARK
H
H    THIS PROGRAM WILL FORMAT AND CHECK
H    LINC TAPES FOR THE PDP-12
H
H    SELECT OPTION AND PRESS LINE FEED
H    ON THE CONSOLE TELETYPE
 
HSELECT  <1
 
H  P  129 WORD FORMAT
H  1  STD 512 BLOCK FORMAT
H  B  896  STD BLKS
H  H  1024 STD BLKS
H  D  DOUBLE MARKED 512 STC BLKS
\Z
 
 
DS2A,	TEXT Z
F MOUNT TAPE TO BE
F MARKED ON THE RIGHT
F REEL OF UNIT 1.
F
F PLACE UNIT 1 IN
\Z
DS2B,	TEXT Z
 
 
 
 
 
F REMOTE WITH 
F WRITE ENABLED, THEN
F 
F PRESS THE MARK SWITCH
\Z
 
 
DS3,	TEXT ZF
F   GOOD TAPE
F
H   ALLOW MARKED TAPE TO REWIND
H   THEN SELECT OPTION AND TYPE
H   LINE FEED ON THE TELETYPE
F
FSELECT  <1
F
F 1 MARK ANOTHER TAPE
F
F 2 RESTART DIAL
\Z
 
 
DS4,	TEXT ZF
F   TAPE CHECK FAILED
F
F
F
FSELECT <1
F
F 1 MARK ANOTHER TAPE
F
F 2  RESTART DIAL
F
\Z
 
 
DS5,	TEXT ZF
F
F  BACK FORTY OK
F
F WAIT FOR FRONT CHECK
F
\Z
	 
	 
